# Soma News (110+; Google News since 127). Bugs Boss found: empty bullets, related-link tails, sideways scrolling,
# the drop capital's spacing.
# A clean start: no shade or dialog left by an earlier walk.
shell cmd statusbar collapse
key BACK
key HOME
launch dev.omalauncher.boss/dev.omalauncher.news.NewsActivity
# The reader's controls appear about 3 s after a fresh start (timed on Fold8); 6 s is safe.
wait 6000
tap Refresh | ↻
wait 8000
expect Top stories
expect Technology
shot stream-cover-new-stories-pill-clear-of-chips
scrollto Show 20 more
tap Show 20 more
wait 800
scrollto Show less
shot topic-expanded
# Back to the top: the chips row scrolls with the stream.
swipe 0.5 0.3 0.5 0.9 300
swipe 0.5 0.3 0.5 0.9 300
swipe 0.5 0.3 0.5 0.9 300
swipe 0.5 0.3 0.5 0.9 300
tap Technology
wait 800
shot jumped-to-technology
# Open a story under Technology: the whole article loads (or the honest "read it there" fallback).
swipe 0.5 0.7 0.5 0.5 300
tap 0.5 0.45
wait 6000
absent Getting the whole story
absent Related stories
absent Read more
shot article
key BACK
# Back keeps him in the stream.
expect SOMA
fold open
rotate landscape
wait 1500
shot stream-landscape
# The cover story fills the left page of the first spread.
tap 0.25 0.45
wait 6000
shot book
rotate portrait
[phone] Check the top bar sits clear of Samsung's status strip on the cover screen and unfolded.
[phone] Swipe system Back from an article (back to the stream), then from the stream (back to home).
